  , Tuple "loop" "{\"glassbox\":2,\"id\":\"loop\",\"title\":\"One loop of a six-loop looper\",\"notes\":[\"Commands, added with the effects fork. Every one of them hangs off a\",\"STATE rather than an edge, so 'entering Recording starts the recorder' is\",\"said once and holds for all four ways in.\",\"\",\"This machine also found the one place the shape is awkward, and it is\",\"recorded here rather than papered over. Playing -> Overdub emits\",\"stop-playback then start-overdub, because leaving Playing exits it; a real\",\"looper wants a handover, not a stop followed by a start. Nothing in the\",\"format is wrong \\u2014 the modelling is, and there are two honest fixes. Either\",\"the host reads the pair as a handover, or overdub stops being a state and\",\"becomes a fact about Playing. It is exactly the case edge-specific\",\"commands were held back to wait for, and it is not yet convincing enough\",\"to add them.\"],\"initial\":\"empty\",\"clock\":\"beats\",\"states\":[{\"id\":\"empty\",\"label\":\"Empty\",\"entry\":[\"discard-audio\"]},{\"id\":\"armed\",\"label\":\"Armed\",\"entry\":[\"start-count-in\"],\"exit\":[\"stop-count-in\"]},{\"id\":\"recording\",\"label\":\"Recording\",\"entry\":[\"start-recorder\"],\"exit\":[\"stop-recorder\"]},{\"id\":\"playing\",\"label\":\"Playing\",\"entry\":[\"start-playback\"],\"exit\":[\"stop-playback\"]},{\"id\":\"overdubbing\",\"label\":\"Overdub\",\"entry\":[\"start-overdub\"],\"exit\":[\"stop-overdub\"]},{\"id\":\"stopped\",\"label\":\"Stopped\"}],\"events\":[{\"id\":\"record\",\"label\":\"record\",\"source\":\"user\"},{\"id\":\"play\",\"label\":\"play\",\"source\":\"user\"},{\"id\":\"stop\",\"label\":\"stop\",\"source\":\"user\"},{\"id\":\"clear\",\"label\":\"clear\",\"source\":\"user\"},{\"id\":\"elapsed\",\"label\":\"count-in\",\"source\":\"runtime\"}],\"config\":[{\"id\":\"count-in-beats\",\"label\":\"Count-in (beats)\",\"default\":4}],\"facts\":[{\"id\":\"converter-held\",\"label\":\"Another loop holds the converter\"}],\"refusals\":[{\"id\":\"converter-busy\",\"text\":\"another loop holds the converter\"},{\"id\":\"nothing-yet\",\"text\":\"nothing recorded yet\"},{\"id\":\"overdub-in-play\",\"text\":\"stopped loops overdub from Playing\"}],\"commands\":[{\"id\":\"discard-audio\",\"label\":\"Throw away this loop's audio\"},{\"id\":\"start-count-in\",\"label\":\"Start the count-in click\"},{\"id\":\"stop-count-in\",\"label\":\"Stop the count-in click\"},{\"id\":\"start-recorder\",\"label\":\"Start recording\"},{\"id\":\"stop-recorder\",\"label\":\"Stop recording\"},{\"id\":\"start-playback\",\"label\":\"Start playing this loop\"},{\"id\":\"stop-playback\",\"label\":\"Stop playing this loop\"},{\"id\":\"start-overdub\",\"label\":\"Start overdubbing onto this loop\"},{\"id\":\"stop-overdub\",\"label\":\"Stop overdubbing\"}],\"rules\":[{\"from\":\"empty\",\"on\":\"record\",\"cases\":[{\"when\":{\"fact\":\"converter-held\"},\"refuse\":\"converter-busy\"},{\"when\":{\"op\":\"gt\",\"left\":{\"config\":\"count-in-beats\"},\"right\":0},\"to\":\"armed\"},{\"to\":\"recording\"}]},{\"from\":\"empty\",\"on\":\"play\",\"cases\":[{\"refuse\":\"nothing-yet\"}]},{\"from\":\"empty\",\"on\":\"stop\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"empty\",\"on\":\"clear\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"empty\",\"on\":\"elapsed\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"armed\",\"on\":\"elapsed\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"recording\"}]},{\"from\":\"armed\",\"on\":\"record\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"empty\"}]},{\"from\":\"armed\",\"on\":\"stop\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"empty\"}]},{\"from\":\"armed\",\"on\":\"clear\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"empty\"}]},{\"from\":\"armed\",\"on\":\"play\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"recording\",\"on\":\"record\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"playing\"}]},{\"from\":\"recording\",\"on\":\"play\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"playing\"}]},{\"from\":\"recording\",\"on\":\"stop\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"stopped\"}]},{\"from\":\"recording\",\"on\":\"clear\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"empty\"}]},{\"from\":\"recording\",\"on\":\"elapsed\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"playing\",\"on\":\"record\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"overdubbing\"}]},{\"from\":\"playing\",\"on\":\"stop\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"stopped\"}]},{\"from\":\"playing\",\"on\":\"clear\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"empty\"}]},{\"from\":\"playing\",\"on\":\"play\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"playing\",\"on\":\"elapsed\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"overdubbing\",\"on\":\"record\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"playing\"}]},{\"from\":\"overdubbing\",\"on\":\"play\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"playing\"}]},{\"from\":\"overdubbing\",\"on\":\"stop\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"stopped\"}]},{\"from\":\"overdubbing\",\"on\":\"clear\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"empty\"}]},{\"from\":\"overdubbing\",\"on\":\"elapsed\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"stopped\",\"on\":\"play\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"playing\"}]},{\"from\":\"stopped\",\"on\":\"clear\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"empty\"}]},{\"from\":\"stopped\",\"on\":\"record\",\"cases\":[{\"refuse\":\"overdub-in-play\"}]},{\"from\":\"stopped\",\"on\":\"stop\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"stopped\",\"on\":\"elapsed\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]}],\"deadlines\":[{\"in\":\"armed\",\"fires\":\"elapsed\",\"after\":{\"config\":\"count-in-beats\"}}]}"
  , Tuple "washing-machine" "{\"glassbox\":2,\"id\":\"washing-machine\",\"title\":\"Washing machine\",\"notes\":[\"Chosen because its natural authoring is a SEQUENCE \\u2014 fill, then wash, then\",\"drain, then rinse, then spin \\u2014 and the format has no word for 'and then'.\",\"Every step of the chain is hand-wired here: each state names its successor\",\"on `step-done`. Reordering the programme means editing every rule in the\",\"chain, which is exactly the kind of restructuring the graphical editor is\",\"supposed to make free.\",\"\",\"The sharper problem is RINSE COUNT. A machine that rinses three times has\",\"no more modes than one that rinses twice \\u2014 rinsing is rinsing \\u2014 so the\",\"count cannot be states without duplicating the cycle. And it cannot be\",\"config either, because config is read, never counted down: this format\",\"gives a machine no memory beyond the state it is in.\",\"\",\"The resolution is the same one the elevator forced: the host keeps the\",\"number and reports a fact. `more-rinses` is the drum controller counting,\",\"not the machine.\",\"\",\"Pause makes it three. Resuming must return to whatever step was\",\"interrupted \\u2014 a Harel history state \\u2014 and this format has no history, so\",\"`paused-in-*` facts carry it and the host remembers. Three instances of one\",\"rule: COUNTS, INDICES, POSITIONS AND HISTORY LIVE IN THE HOST, because a\",\"machine here has no memory beyond the state it is in. Nothing in the format\",\"says so, and a designer who does not know it will build a state per rinse\",\"and a paused-state per step.\",\"\",\"Commands make a fourth point, and a happier one. Twelve states share eight\",\"commands: `fill-drum` serves both Filling and Rinse fill, `tumble` serves\",\"both Washing and Rinsing. A command is a word in the host's vocabulary,\",\"not a name for a state, and the reuse is what proves it. There is not one\",\"exit command in the whole machine \\u2014 a step ends because the next step\",\"starts.\"],\"initial\":\"idle\",\"states\":[{\"id\":\"idle\",\"label\":\"Idle\"},{\"id\":\"locking\",\"label\":\"Locking\",\"entry\":[\"lock-door\"]},{\"id\":\"prewashing\",\"label\":\"Prewash\",\"entry\":[\"fill-drum\",\"tumble\"]},{\"id\":\"filling\",\"label\":\"Filling\",\"entry\":[\"fill-drum\"]},{\"id\":\"washing\",\"label\":\"Washing\",\"entry\":[\"heat-water\",\"tumble\"]},{\"id\":\"draining\",\"label\":\"Draining\",\"entry\":[\"drain\"]},{\"id\":\"rinse-filling\",\"label\":\"Rinse fill\",\"entry\":[\"fill-drum\"]},{\"id\":\"rinsing\",\"label\":\"Rinsing\",\"entry\":[\"tumble\"]},{\"id\":\"spinning\",\"label\":\"Spinning\",\"entry\":[\"drain\",\"spin\"]},{\"id\":\"unlocking\",\"label\":\"Unlocking\",\"entry\":[\"unlock-door\"]},{\"id\":\"done\",\"label\":\"Done\",\"final\":true,\"entry\":[\"chime\"]},{\"id\":\"paused\",\"label\":\"Paused\",\"entry\":[\"hold-everything\"]}],\"events\":[{\"id\":\"start\",\"label\":\"start\",\"source\":\"user\"},{\"id\":\"pause\",\"label\":\"pause\",\"source\":\"user\"},{\"id\":\"resume\",\"label\":\"resume\",\"source\":\"user\"},{\"id\":\"cancel\",\"label\":\"cancel\",\"source\":\"user\"},{\"id\":\"open\",\"label\":\"open door\",\"source\":\"user\"},{\"id\":\"step-done\",\"label\":\"step complete\",\"source\":\"runtime\"}],\"config\":[{\"id\":\"has-prewash\",\"label\":\"Prewash in this programme\",\"default\":false}],\"facts\":[{\"id\":\"door-shut\",\"label\":\"The door is shut\"},{\"id\":\"more-rinses\",\"label\":\"The controller wants another rinse\"},{\"id\":\"drum-wet\",\"label\":\"There is water in the drum\"},{\"id\":\"paused-in-fill\",\"label\":\"Paused while filling\"},{\"id\":\"paused-in-rinse\",\"label\":\"Paused while rinsing\"}],\"refusals\":[{\"id\":\"door-ajar\",\"text\":\"the door is not shut\"},{\"id\":\"door-locked\",\"text\":\"the door is locked while the drum is running\"},{\"id\":\"still-wet\",\"text\":\"the drum must drain before the door opens\"},{\"id\":\"not-running\",\"text\":\"nothing is running\"}],\"commands\":[{\"id\":\"lock-door\",\"label\":\"Lock the door\"},{\"id\":\"unlock-door\",\"label\":\"Unlock the door\"},{\"id\":\"fill-drum\",\"label\":\"Fill the drum\"},{\"id\":\"heat-water\",\"label\":\"Heat the water\"},{\"id\":\"tumble\",\"label\":\"Tumble the drum\"},{\"id\":\"drain\",\"label\":\"Drain the drum\"},{\"id\":\"spin\",\"label\":\"Spin\"},{\"id\":\"hold-everything\",\"label\":\"Hold everything where it is\"},{\"id\":\"chime\",\"label\":\"Sound the end-of-cycle chime\"}],\"rules\":[{\"from\":\"idle\",\"on\":\"start\",\"cases\":[{\"when\":{\"not\":{\"fact\":\"door-shut\"}},\"refuse\":\"door-ajar\"},{\"to\":\"locking\"}]},{\"from\":\"idle\",\"on\":\"open\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"idle\",\"on\":\"pause\",\"cases\":[{\"refuse\":\"not-running\"}]},{\"from\":\"idle\",\"on\":\"resume\",\"cases\":[{\"refuse\":\"not-running\"}]},{\"from\":\"idle\",\"on\":\"cancel\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"idle\",\"on\":\"step-done\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"locking\",\"on\":\"step-done\",\"cases\":[{\"when\":{\"config\":\"has-prewash\"},\"to\":\"prewashing\"},{\"to\":\"filling\"}]},{\"from\":\"locking\",\"on\":\"cancel\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"unlocking\"}]},{\"from\":\"locking\",\"on\":\"open\",\"cases\":[{\"refuse\":\"door-locked\"}]},{\"from\":\"locking\",\"on\":\"pause\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"paused\"}]},{\"from\":\"locking\",\"on\":\"resume\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"locking\",\"on\":\"start\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"prewashing\",\"on\":\"step-done\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"draining\"}]},{\"from\":\"prewashing\",\"on\":\"pause\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"paused\"}]},{\"from\":\"prewashing\",\"on\":\"cancel\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"draining\"}]},{\"from\":\"prewashing\",\"on\":\"open\",\"cases\":[{\"refuse\":\"door-locked\"}]},{\"from\":\"prewashing\",\"on\":\"resume\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"prewashing\",\"on\":\"start\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"filling\",\"on\":\"step-done\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"washing\"}]},{\"from\":\"filling\",\"on\":\"pause\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"paused\"}]},{\"from\":\"filling\",\"on\":\"cancel\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"draining\"}]},{\"from\":\"filling\",\"on\":\"open\",\"cases\":[{\"refuse\":\"door-locked\"}]},{\"from\":\"filling\",\"on\":\"resume\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"filling\",\"on\":\"start\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"washing\",\"on\":\"step-done\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"draining\"}]},{\"from\":\"washing\",\"on\":\"pause\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"paused\"}]},{\"from\":\"washing\",\"on\":\"cancel\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"draining\"}]},{\"from\":\"washing\",\"on\":\"open\",\"cases\":[{\"refuse\":\"door-locked\"}]},{\"from\":\"washing\",\"on\":\"resume\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"washing\",\"on\":\"start\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"draining\",\"on\":\"step-done\",\"cases\":[{\"when\":{\"fact\":\"more-rinses\"},\"to\":\"rinse-filling\"},{\"to\":\"spinning\"}]},{\"from\":\"draining\",\"on\":\"pause\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"draining\",\"on\":\"cancel\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"draining\",\"on\":\"open\",\"cases\":[{\"refuse\":\"door-locked\"}]},{\"from\":\"draining\",\"on\":\"resume\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"draining\",\"on\":\"start\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"rinse-filling\",\"on\":\"step-done\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"rinsing\"}]},{\"from\":\"rinse-filling\",\"on\":\"pause\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"paused\"}]},{\"from\":\"rinse-filling\",\"on\":\"cancel\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"draining\"}]},{\"from\":\"rinse-filling\",\"on\":\"open\",\"cases\":[{\"refuse\":\"door-locked\"}]},{\"from\":\"rinse-filling\",\"on\":\"resume\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"rinse-filling\",\"on\":\"start\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"rinsing\",\"on\":\"step-done\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"draining\"}]},{\"from\":\"rinsing\",\"on\":\"pause\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"paused\"}]},{\"from\":\"rinsing\",\"on\":\"cancel\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"draining\"}]},{\"from\":\"rinsing\",\"on\":\"open\",\"cases\":[{\"refuse\":\"door-locked\"}]},{\"from\":\"rinsing\",\"on\":\"resume\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"rinsing\",\"on\":\"start\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"spinning\",\"on\":\"step-done\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"unlocking\"}]},{\"from\":\"spinning\",\"on\":\"pause\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"paused\"}]},{\"from\":\"spinning\",\"on\":\"cancel\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"unlocking\"}]},{\"from\":\"spinning\",\"on\":\"open\",\"cases\":[{\"refuse\":\"door-locked\"}]},{\"from\":\"spinning\",\"on\":\"resume\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"spinning\",\"on\":\"start\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"unlocking\",\"on\":\"step-done\",\"cases\":[{\"when\":{\"fact\":\"drum-wet\"},\"refuse\":\"still-wet\"},{\"to\":\"done\"}]},{\"from\":\"unlocking\",\"on\":\"open\",\"cases\":[{\"refuse\":\"door-locked\"}]},{\"from\":\"unlocking\",\"on\":\"pause\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"unlocking\",\"on\":\"resume\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"unlocking\",\"on\":\"cancel\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"unlocking\",\"on\":\"start\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"done\",\"on\":\"open\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"idle\"}]},{\"from\":\"done\",\"on\":\"start\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"locking\"}]},{\"from\":\"done\",\"on\":\"pause\",\"cases\":[{\"refuse\":\"not-running\"}]},{\"from\":\"done\",\"on\":\"resume\",\"cases\":[{\"refuse\":\"not-running\"}]},{\"from\":\"done\",\"on\":\"cancel\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"done\",\"on\":\"step-done\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"paused\",\"on\":\"resume\",\"cases\":[{\"when\":{\"fact\":\"paused-in-rinse\"},\"to\":\"rinsing\"},{\"when\":{\"fact\":\"paused-in-fill\"},\"to\":\"filling\"},{\"to\":\"washing\"}]},{\"from\":\"paused\",\"on\":\"cancel\",\"cases\":[{\"to\":\"draining\"}]},{\"from\":\"paused\",\"on\":\"open\",\"cases\":[{\"refuse\":\"door-locked\"}]},{\"from\":\"paused\",\"on\":\"pause\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"paused\",\"on\":\"start\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]},{\"from\":\"paused\",\"on\":\"step-done\",\"cases\":[{\"stay\":true}]}],\"deadlines\":[]}"
  , Tuple "supervise-group" "{\"glassbox\":2,\"id\":\"supervise-group\",\"title\":\"A supervised group, as seen from the Chair\",\"notes\":[\"The lifecycle of one `bosun supervise` group \\u2014 the machine that is currently\",\"implicit in `Bosun.CLI.Supervise.superviseResident`, where its whole state is a\",\"`Ref Boolean` named `desiredUp` and its transitions are the arms of a `case verb`.\",\"\",\"Written as an artifact to find out what the format could and could not say about a\",\"real supervisor. Three things it said that the code does not:\",\"\",\"1. `held` and `raised` are STATES, not a Boolean. `--held` was added late, and a\",\"   Boolean has no room for the four transient states below, so they do not exist\",\"   in the code and the Chair cannot show them.\",\"\",\"2. Every command hangs off a state, so a moment that runs a command has to BE a\",\"   state. `raising`, `lowering`, `restarting`, `reloading` and `adopting` are the\",\"   format forcing into existence the in-flight moments the code runs synchronously\",\"   inside a control handler. That is the same thing the follow button's two pending\",\"   states were, and it is why a control verb arriving mid-transition can be refused\",\"   as `busy` here and cannot be there.\",\"\",\"3. `restart` and `reload` are REFUSED while held. Today they are not gated on\",\"   `desiredUp` at all, so `POST /control/restart?x` on a group booted with `--held`\",\"   launches x \\u2014 quietly defeating the point of holding it. Nothing was decided\",\"   wrongly; the cell was simply never written down, which is what totality is for.\",\"\",\"`tick` in `raised` is a Move to the state it is already in \\u2014 the statechart external\",\"self-transition \\u2014 so it exits and re-enters, and re-entering runs `reconcile`. That\",\"is the keep-alive loop, and it costs one word.\",\"\",\"No deadlines. A supervisor is full of timing, but the group's own lifecycle has\",\"none: the tick is a recurring heartbeat the host o